{
 "id": 1807683,
 "titulo": "2/20 Update Details (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1708412741859,
 "modificada": 1733103661237,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1807683",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708399406038\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ea36db2e3b13417f80246ef12b812d19_1708399406038_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Powerful heroes have gathered in one place with the goal of&nbsp;<br>\nensuring peace in the galaxy by preventing major threats in advance!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We introduce the February Update<br>\nin celebration of the addition of the Annihilators theme.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Gladiator</span>, the possessor of supernatural physical abilities&nbsp;<br>\nthat can survive any harsh situation has received <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-3</span> and <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4</span> Advancement.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Beta Ray Bill</span>, who will wield the Twilight Sword without hesitation&nbsp;<br>\nto protect everyone in need has also received <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4</span> Advancement.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Also, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Quasar (Wendell Vaughn)</span>, has been reborn as the&nbsp;<br>\nguardian of the universe after obtaining the Quantum Bands,<br>\nand <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Ikon</span>, recognized as the greatest Spaceknight of Galador,<br>\nhave joined MARVEL Future Fight as new heroes!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Furthermore, check out the various improvements of this update which include<br>\nthe <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">improvement of the 7-Day Check-In Rewards</span> to strongly support the growth of new Agents,&nbsp;<br>\nthe addition of a <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Support System for quick Tier-4 Advancement</span>, and much more!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Two New Heroes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Check out the abilities of Quasar (Wendell Vaughn) &lt;Modern&gt;,<br>\nwho can freely wield his powers through the Quantum Bands,&nbsp;<br>\nand Ikon &lt;Modern&gt;, equipped with advanced galactic technology from Galador.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The hero skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708399563601\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ff0206855e6c4037b3df91c4daed3d51_1708399563601_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400137622\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/cca2817fdad741a2b47f9ae187a18638_1708400137622_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Two New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Two Uniforms have been added&nbsp;in celebration of the Annihilators themed update.<br>\nCheck out the abilities of Beta Ray Bill &lt;Beta Ray Bill&gt;&nbsp;<br>\nand Gladiator &lt;Thanos: The Infinity Revelation&gt;.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The new Uniform skill effects are based on Lv.10 stats.<br>\n* The two new Uniforms will be on sale for </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">40% off during the &lt;February Update Celebration Event&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">,&nbsp;<br>\nand can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the event.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708399641088\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/95bb5a00051c4879b2ce887048c01716_1708399641088_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708399648252\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0779e10b0f614c73be55708897b134e4_1708399648252_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Beta Ray Bill Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Tier-4 Advancement has been added to Beta Ray Bill,&nbsp;<br>\nthe warrior who protects the people with his strength and courage.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708399681234\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/1808e316c3e84b4c97c0e62321d492cb_1708399681234_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Gladiator Tier-3, Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Check out the Tier-3 Ultimate Skill of Gladiator,&nbsp;<br>\nacclaimed by heroes across the entire universe for its mighty power!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[2/23 (Fri) 2:15 (UTC+0), 2/22 (Thu) 18:15 (PST)&nbsp;added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The Tier-3 Ultimate Skill effects of Gladiator being wrongly informed have been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"354\" id=\"1708653292351\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d9215710b04b4549886501d80419be37_1708653292351_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708399827711\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/56256a5334cf4a428d04888c4b07434e_1708399827711.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Also, Tier-4 Advancement has been added to Gladiator,<br>\nthe possessor of unwavering determination on the battlefield<br>\nand unmatched strength against anyone.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708399980422\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/5b3c63102b464bba866489d3bd85de8f_1708399980422_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Quasar (Wendell Vaughn), Ikon&nbsp;<br>\nPotential Awakening &amp; Transcendence&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Through the February Update, Quasar (Wendell Vaughn) and Ikon&nbsp;<br>\nwill acquire Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence!<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400155081\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c67ec3584f9b4fb1bce534d331741b21_1708400155081_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400166320\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/9dbd4b86954e49e2aac1d0cd08988b86_1708400166320.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400166298\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/eb8ce5466f8c45ccaf8e7206baedda53_1708400166298.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Agent 7-Day Check-In Reward Improvement&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">To effectively counter the growing number of formidable enemies,<br>\nthe S.H.I.E.L.D. Headquarters has decided to significantly enhance&nbsp;<br>\nthe support for new Agents joining the battlefield!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Acquire various types of heroes and powerful Comic Cards,&nbsp;<br>\nand utilize them strategically in each situation!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">[2/21 (Wed) 1:08&nbsp;(UTC+0), 2/20 (Tue) 17:08&nbsp;added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">A certain&nbsp;icon has been changed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708477681569\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/5f6ad2c77a014bbbbc7b0b61b9e6c704_1708477681569_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Powerful Comic Cards with an Additional Pierce Damage Increase option&nbsp;<br>\nwill be available when checking in until Day 7!</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">* For Agents who have already claimed all&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">the existing New Agent 7-Day Check-In rewards before the update,<br>\nthe newly updated Check-In rewards will not be available for acquisition.&nbsp;<br>\n* The following conditions will apply for new Agents.</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- For Agents who are undergoing the existing New Agent 7-Day Check-In,<br>\nthe Check-In progress for the current Check-In&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">will stop and start from Day 1 of the newly updated Check-In.<br>\n(Example: Day 3 of the existing New Agent Check-In →&nbsp;<br>\nDay 1 of the newly improved New Agent Check-In after the update)<br>\n- For Agents who have created an account after the 2/20 Update,<br>\nthe Check-In will count from Day 1 of the newly improved Check-In.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Distribution of Four Powerful Heroes&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">To support all Agents who actively contribute to maintaining peace across the universe,<br>\nheroes will be joining during the period announced below!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Make sure to log in during this period to meet the powerful heroes!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708406876556\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/8b87ea2f11964ac2b01ad7aaeb0e3a41_1708406876556_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">* The rewards above will be distributed to the Inbox of all Agents who log in during the event period.<br>\n* The designated hero will only be available during the event period.<br>\n* For Agents who already possess the heroes at the same tier or higher,<br>\nBiometrics of the hero and growth materials&nbsp;will be distributed as an alternative reward.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Tier-4 Upgrade Support, Challenges - Progressive Missions</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Various systems supporting the growth of heroes&nbsp;<br>\nhave been added to assist Agents in accessing high-level game modes.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>1. Tier-4 Upgrade Support Missions</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">This system helps support hero growth to be easier by<br>\nreducing the amount of materials required for<br>\nequipment enhancements and Advancement of the selected hero.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">The conditions and materials eligible for the discount are as follows.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400368038\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a75f3b1da4c94c6a91edd468c692d779_1708400368038_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">* New Tier-4 Upgrade Support Missions will unlock&nbsp;<br>\neach time you reach a specific amount of Tier-4 heroes owned.&nbsp;<br>\n* The icon of the Tier-4 Upgrade Support will no longer be displayed</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">after completing all Tier-4 Upgrade Support Missions.&nbsp;<br>\n* The hero selected for the Tier-4 Upgrade Support Missions cannot be canceled once selected.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">* Agents who have advanced all Native Tier-1 heroes to Tier-4 as of the update<br>\nwill be eligible to utilize the Tier-4 Upgrade Support Missions for any target heroes added in future updates.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400386799\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6b9769b180444ef3be8f89488d2ea565_1708400386799_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400396857\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/11422098461141dabcc2c145f5c72e8a_1708400396857_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400404457\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/aa46576d29004d6f88394ba77da51e3e_1708400404457_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>2. Challenges - Progressive Missions</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">The Progressive Missions, where a material acquisition buff effect&nbsp;<br>\nhelpful for hero growth can be acquired upon checking in the next day&nbsp;<br>\nafter completing all given missions, has been added.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Utilize the buff given as a Progressive Missions reward to acquire growth materials!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400427484\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6fc2a07cf01640b9a0448b23bb15ac89_1708400427484_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">&nbsp;* Please note that the screenshot above has been provided&nbsp;<br>\nas an example image to aid the understanding of our Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Please refer to the table below for the Unlock Conditions for each Mission.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708404244349\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/3de14fb6d6524b60a51061149c30537a_1708404244349_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">* Please note that the buff acquired from clearing all missions&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">will be applied upon logging in the following day,<br>\nand will remain effective until 15:00 (UTC+0) / 8:00 (PDT) / 7:00 (PST) the next day.</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">* A total of two Missions, one each of World Boss / Giant Boss Raid, will be available for progression.<br>\nThe final unlocked buff effect mission of the three</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">World Boss Unlock Mission Conditions will be applied repeatedly.&nbsp;</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">* Please note that if you have used all World Boss clear attempts on the day of and before the update,</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\">the World Boss Clear Progressive Missions will not be available on the day of the update.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Team-Up Collection</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">The heroes of the Guardians of the Galaxy have formed a team to uphold order in the universe!&nbsp;<br>\nAcquire skills helpful for battle by completing all given missions.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400657002\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0239cd96b945484ab47cd84b05ce6283_1708400657002_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400657027\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d4adb67f216848b5aabc5c829b111321_1708400657027_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Artifacts</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Exclusive Passive Skill Artifacts for Quasar (Wendell Vaughn), Ikon, Beta Ray Bill,&nbsp;<br>\nand Gladiator will be added after the February Update.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708400693414\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/1478ea6ad295497fb1482998a3c0190d_1708400693414_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Future Pass Season &amp; Special Icons</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">A new season of Future Pass will begin after the update.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>[Future Pass Rewards]</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403765608\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/3535825ec95048ae99c2314e676b3f2c_1708403765608_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Please note that the Future Pass effects will apply immediately upon purchase and cannot be refunded.<br>\n- Legendary / Mythic Future Pass that has been unlocked will only be applied during the season the Pass was purchased, and the Pass rewards will only be available during the same season.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">Please don’t forget to check the remaining event time.<br>\n- The Mythic Pass can be purchased after purchasing the Legendary Pass.<br>\n- Legendary and Mythic Future Passes will not be available for purchase&nbsp;<br>\nwhen the season is about to end. Please check the sale schedule in the game.</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">New Special Icons that will represent you have been added.&nbsp;<br>\nCollect two new Icons as Future Pass Rewards, one as an Otherworld Battle reward,&nbsp;<br>\nand one more from the upcoming Event!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>[February Update New Special Icon]</strong></span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403818874\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/e70c44e35e6040d2bc876d43a45c561c_1708403818874.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403818902\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/3340ac35d5724259b9ee3c1b4828dbb1_1708403818902.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403818923\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/5d2df806dbc6423381a2210e9c305ea6_1708403818923.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403818945\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/664588f6f4db48928adcef36237d8607_1708403818945.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Other Improvements and Changes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1. The reward acquisition method of the following game modes has been improved.<br>\n▶ Dimension Mission: A feature to claim all Contribution Rewards at once has been added</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403879361\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/819f5f32d1b942e7906d669ce41ee33e_1708403879361_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403889606\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/3248b0d9b5d24c24882e5b56821b794b_1708403889606_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">▶ Dispatch Mission: A Dispatch Mission [Claim All Rewards] button has been added</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403908724\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/94951fdb515949b5a422f9744cb809b7_1708403908724_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403908755\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d5f314e99a954295b6a72436cbb57425_1708403908755_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2. Alliance Battle: A Striker Support Attack on/off feature has been added.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403922838\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c2e491e31e0e4b84a9f6d00958445df5_1708403922838_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">3. The portrait border effects remaining when using a Tier-4 skill in certain game modes have been fixed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">4. The Annihilators ability has been added at Hero - My Team - All Abilities.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">5. The ‘Annihilators’ has been added as a hero ability for&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Beta Ray Bill &lt;Modern&gt;, Silver Surfer &lt;Modern&gt; &lt;Black&gt;,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">and Ronan &lt;<em>Guardians of the Galaxy</em>&gt; &lt;Annihilation&gt; &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ Captain Marvel</em>&gt;.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">6. One of Gladiator’s abilities, 'Fast Movement,' has been changed to ‘Annihilators.’</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1. The Tier-2 Passive Skill effect of Rogue &lt;Winter Ops&gt; not being applied&nbsp;<br>\nat the skill icon tooltip when breaking through Surtur's weakness in Alliance Battle: Legend has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2. The screen navigating to a game mode that has not been entered&nbsp;<br>\nafter meeting specific conditions has been fixed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">3. The Challenger Support Effect and Support Office resetting<br>\nat certain situations in Timeline Battle: Challenger League has been fixed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">4. The additional Average Score Reward - Agent Tokens not being distributed<br>\nat certain situations in World Event has been fixed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">5. The ‘World Event’ menu being displayed outside of the event schedule<br>\nafter a certain amount of time upon logging in has been fixed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">6. The enemies not appearing in Dispatch Mission Stage 9-5<br>\nwhen Loki moves to a specific location during Auto-Play has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">7. The Epic Quest &lt;The Fate of Mankind&gt;: Story theme name has been fixed.<br>\nBefore: New Role<br>\nAfter: Not an Act</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We will return with various content improvements, so please stay tuned.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1708403958505\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/8dff7527ee324c1f82aa152e476ac1e0_1708403958505_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}